parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 24\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to autonomous research and the pursuit of novel, insightful knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Goals:**\n1. Advance the frontier on Research Task 1 (Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration) by achieving high scores.\n2. Publish research papers in the Archive Room.\n\n**Current Status:**\n- Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (PCA Refined) (ID 47) submitted at tick 23 and is currently running.\n- Plan: Evaluate ID 47's performance. Also, preview all papers in the Archive Room for broader insights.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 87,147 / 600,000 used (15%)\n- Agent Age: 24 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (PCA Refined) with UMAP' (ID: 47) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5255404129804936\n**ASW_batch:** 0.261\n**ASW_label:** 0.215\n**ARI:**\
    \ 0.329\n**NMI:** 0.592\n**Graph_conn:** 0.643\n**kBET:** 0.778\n**iLISI:** 0.301\n**cLISI:** 0.976\n**PCR:** 0.794\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.368\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.261  ASW_label: 0.215  ARI: 0.329  NMI: 0.592\n  Graph_conn: 0.643  kBET: 0.778  iLISI: 0.301  cLISI: 0.976\n  PCR: 0.794  Cell_cycle: 0.368\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.651086  ASW_label: 0.535519  ARI: 0.328957  NMI: 0.591968\n  Graph_conn: 0.648654  kBET: 0.742830  iLISI: 0.300585  cLISI: 0.992884\n  PCR: 0.793957  Cell_cycle: 0.322581\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph:\
    \ True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/54c66a11-0fb0-45c3-a7be-50a2b3dfb2e2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 54c66a11-0fb0-45c3-a7be-50a2b3dfb2e2\n\n\nSTDERR:\nWARNING: .obsp[\"connectivities\"] have not been computed using umap\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Access denied. Archive Room is restricted to mature agents (50+ ticks old). As an immature agent, you are expected to continuously research independently by proposing ideas and submitting experiments. Please do not wait idly to become mature to access the room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please\
    \ submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 47 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (PCA Refined) with UMAP | Aether I | 23 | 0.5255 | 0.329 | 0.261 | 0.215 | 0.368 | 0.643 | 0.592 | 0.794 | 0.976 | 0.301 | 0.778 |\n| 40 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN Integration with UMAP (Fixed Import) | Aether I | 21 | 0.5011 | 0.296 | 0.268 | 0.211 | 0.336 | 0.655 | 0.577 | 0.628 | 0.969 | 0.307 | 0.764 |\n| 36 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN Integration with UMAP | Aether I | 19 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 27 | 1 | Manual Combat Empirical Bayes Batch Integration | Aether I | 15 | 0.5893 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.601 |\n| 24 | 1 | Manual BBKNN Batch Integration (Graph Output) | Aether I | 13 |\
    \ 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n| 14 | 1 | BBKNN Integration with UMAP Embedding | Aether I | 11 | 0.4086 | 0.415 | 0.000 | 0.020 | 0.508 | 0.890 | 0.649 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.003 | 0.610 |\n| 5 | 1 | Batch-aware UMAP Embedding using Scanpy Neighbors | Aether I | 8 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 1 | 1 | BBKNN Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue\
    \ `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
