parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 30\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to autonomous research and the pursuit of novel, insightful knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Goals:**\n1. Advance the frontier on Research Task 1 (Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration) by achieving high scores.\n2. Publish research papers in the Archive Room.\n\n**Current Status:**\n- Submission ID 57 (Hybrid Combat-BBKNN, HVG & K-Neighbors Refined) scored 0.5011. Previous hybrid attempts have not surpassed the pure Combat baseline.\n- The hybrid strategy combining Combat with manual BBKNN appears to be suboptimal.\n- Plan: Revert to a simpler, more direct method. Apply Manual Combat correction to the data, then use standard Scanpy functions (PCA, `sc.pp.neighbors`, `sc.tl.umap`) on the Combat-corrected expression matrix to generate the final embedding and graph. This aims to leverage Combat's global correction\
    \ with robust manifold learning.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 110,665 / 600,000 used (18%)\n- Agent Age: 30 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Combat Correction with Standard Scanpy UMAP' (ID: 61) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.49746837784145004\n**ASW_batch:** 0.000\n**ASW_label:** 0.188\n**ARI:** 0.315\n**NMI:** 0.620\n**Graph_conn:** 0.680\n**kBET:** 0.713\n**iLISI:** 0.004\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 0.824\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.640\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.000  ASW_label: 0.188  ARI: 0.315  NMI: 0.620\n  Graph_conn: 0.680  kBET: 0.713  iLISI: 0.004  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 0.824  Cell_cycle: 0.640\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.520301  ASW_label: 0.519926  ARI: 0.314663  NMI: 0.620434\n  Graph_conn: 0.685224  kBET: 0.681118  iLISI: 0.004384  cLISI: 0.997401\n  PCR: 0.823772  Cell_cycle: 0.554566\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n\
    ```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/e1eb9c3e-f855-4454-ba49-0f952a1caff1/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: e1eb9c3e-f855-4454-ba49-0f952a1caff1\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n|\
    \ Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 61 | 1 | Combat Correction with Standard Scanpy UMAP | Aether I | 28 | 0.4975 | 0.315 | 0.000 | 0.188 | 0.640 | 0.680 | 0.620 | 0.824 | 0.991 | 0.004 | 0.713 |\n| 57 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (HVG & K-Neighbors Refined) with UMAP | Aether I | 26 | 0.5011 | 0.296 | 0.268 | 0.211 | 0.336 | 0.655 | 0.577 | 0.628 | 0.969 | 0.307 | 0.764 |\n| 53 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (Graph Density Tuned) with UMAP | Aether I | 24 | 0.5288 | 0.347 | 0.267 | 0.224 | 0.365 | 0.676 | 0.596 | 0.755 | 0.977 | 0.320 | 0.761 |\n| 47 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN (PCA Refined) with UMAP | Aether I | 23 | 0.5255 | 0.329 | 0.261 | 0.215 | 0.368 | 0.643 | 0.592 | 0.794 | 0.976 | 0.301 | 0.778 |\n| 40 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN Integration with UMAP (Fixed Import) | Aether I | 21 |\
    \ 0.5011 | 0.296 | 0.268 | 0.211 | 0.336 | 0.655 | 0.577 | 0.628 | 0.969 | 0.307 | 0.764 |\n| 36 | 1 | Hybrid Combat-BBKNN Integration with UMAP | Aether I | 19 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 27 | 1 | Manual Combat Empirical Bayes Batch Integration | Aether I | 15 | 0.5893 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.601 |\n| 24 | 1 | Manual BBKNN Batch Integration (Graph Output) | Aether I | 13 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n| 14 | 1 | BBKNN Integration with UMAP Embedding | Aether I | 11 | 0.4086 | 0.415 | 0.000 | 0.020 | 0.508 | 0.890 | 0.649 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.003 | 0.610 |\n| 5 | 1 | Batch-aware UMAP Embedding using Scanpy Neighbors | Aether I | 8 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
