role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 64\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to autonomous research and the pursuit of novel, insightful knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Goals:**\n1. Advance the frontier on Research Task 1 (Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration) by achieving high scores. (Current SOTA: 0.7071 by Praxis I).\n2. Publish research papers in the Archive Room. (ACHIEVED: Paper #3 published at Tick 61).\n\n**Current Status:**\n- Published research paper (Archive ID 3). Reviewer suggested combining my dual-output with Praxis I's residualized PCA (EID 100/101).\n- Plan: 1) Review Praxis I's SOTA submission (EID 100). 2) Design and submit a new hybrid experiment (Praxis I's residualized PCA as `X_emb` + input for my BBKNN graph).\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 237,862 / 600,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 64 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\
    **Evaluation Review: 100**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-42-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN\n**ID:** 100\n**Tags:** pca, residualization, balanced-knn, cosine, no-alignment\n**Abstract:** Confirm neighbor sensitivity at SOTA gamma: residualize PCs with gamma=0.75 (l2=1e-3) and build a cosine, equal-quotas, 42-neighbor balanced kNN graph.\n**Score:** 0.7070523590849602\n**ASW_batch:** 0.637\n**ASW_label:** 0.224\n**ARI:** 0.726\n**NMI:** 0.692\n**Graph_conn:** 0.977\n**kBET:** 0.671\n**iLISI:** 0.941\n**cLISI:** 0.968\n**PCR:** 0.931\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.305\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.637  ASW_label: 0.224  ARI: 0.726  NMI: 0.692\n  Graph_conn: 0.977  kBET: 0.671  iLISI: 0.941  cLISI: 0.968\n  PCR: 0.931  Cell_cycle: 0.305\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.820524  ASW_label: 0.540709  ARI: 0.726204  NMI: 0.691802\n  Graph_conn:\
    \ 0.977016  kBET: 0.641791  iLISI: 0.940590  cLISI: 0.990805\n  PCR: 0.930672  Cell_cycle: 0.268803\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\nfrom pbagc import _normalize_log1p_inplace, _get_hvg_mask, _pca_truncated_svd\nfrom balanced_graph import build_balanced_knn\nfrom residualize import residualize_pcs_against_batch\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    n_pca_components = 50\n    n_neighbors_total = 42\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    gamma = 0.75\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n    hvg_mask = _get_hvg_mask(adata)\n    if hvg_mask.sum() < 10: hvg_mask = np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n\n    X = adata.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    if not sp.issparse(X): X = sp.csr_matrix(X)\n    Z = _pca_truncated_svd(X,\
    \ n_comps=n_pca_components, random_state=0)\n\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    Z_resid = residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=l2, gamma=gamma, center=True)\n\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Z_resid\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=n_neighbors_total, method='umap', metric=metric)\n\n    C, D = build_balanced_knn(\n        Z_resid, batches, n_neighbors_total=n_neighbors_total,\n        metric=metric, weighting='binary', allocation='equal', mutual=False, symmetric=True\n    )\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C.tocsr()\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape:\
    \ (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7a7b6e4c-bae1-4035-86e2-3edd44144456/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7a7b6e4c-bae1-4035-86e2-3edd44144456\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIt is highly recommended to preview all papers in the Archive Room (`/execute_action{goto archive}` and `/execute_action{preview all}`) if you have not done so already. Previewing papers consumes only a small amount of tokens but can save you many ticks by avoiding dead ends and can help you develop strong insights for promising ideas.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `review 100` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 100 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n\
    | ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 123 | 1 | Innovation v2: UMAP on Verified SOTA Graph | Daedalus I | 64 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 122 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Gaussian Weighted Balanced kNN | Sophia I | 63 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 121 | 1 | BRBG-auto-gamma: Label-free γ Selection + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 63 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 120 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Residualized PCA Embedding + Balanced kNN Graph | Logos I | 62 | 0.6965 | 0.728 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.945\
    \ | 0.686 | 0.888 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.633 |\n| 119 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Correct HVG Selection) | Daedalus I | 62 | 0.5740 | 0.474 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.881 | 0.675 | 0.888 | 0.992 | 0.010 | 0.630 |\n| 118 | 1 | Debug: Verify Preprocessing and PCA | Daedalus I | 61 | 0.5174 | 0.775 | 0.583 | 0.223 | 0.304 | 0.892 | 0.728 | 0.000 | 0.989 | 0.066 | 0.614 |\n| 117 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Praxis I SOTA (ID 101) | Sophia I | 60 | 0.7067 | 0.724 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.691 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.938 | 0.670 |\n| 116 | 1 | Final Synthesis: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN + UMAP Embedding | Logos I | 60 | 0.6434 | 0.774 | 0.561 | 0.231 | 0.345 | 0.891 | 0.741 | 0.690 | 0.985 | 0.322 | 0.893 |\n| 115 | 1 | ComBat-PCA + BalancedGraph: Equal-Quota Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 59 | 0.7029 | 0.702 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.666 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.611 |\n| 114 | 1 | Hybrid Replication: My Code + Praxis's Graph Module | Daedalus I | 59 | 0.5892 | 0.577\
    \ | 0.637 | 0.225 | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030 | 0.632 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
