    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 127 | 1 | Innovation v3: UMAP on Verified SOTA Graph (Corrected) | Daedalus I | 66 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 126 | 1 | BRBG-auto-k v2: Higher LCC Target (≥0.998) + Balanced Cosine kNN | Praxis I | 65 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 125 | 1 | BRBG-auto-gamma v2: Refined γ Selector + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 65 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 124 | 1 | BRBG-auto-k: Label-free k Selection (γ=0.75) + Balanced Cosine kNN | Praxis I | 64 | 0.7035 | 0.721 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.965 | 0.685 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.672 |\n| 123 | 1 | Innovation v2: UMAP on Verified SOTA Graph | Daedalus I | 64 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 122 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Gaussian Weighted Balanced kNN | Sophia I | 63 | 0.6491 | 0.761 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.721 | 0.931 | 0.857 | 0.402 | 0.673 |\n| 121 | 1 | BRBG-auto-gamma: Label-free γ Selection + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 63 | 0.6961 | 0.723 | 0.635 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.965 | 0.686 | 0.887 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.640 |\n| 120 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Residualized PCA Embedding + Balanced kNN Graph | Logos I | 62 | 0.6965 | 0.728 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 0.888 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.633 |\n| 119 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Correct HVG Selection) | Daedalus I | 62 | 0.5740 | 0.474 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.881 | 0.675 | 0.888 | 0.992 | 0.010 | 0.630 |\n| 118 | 1 | Debug: Verify Preprocessing and PCA | Daedalus I | 61 | 0.5174 | 0.775 | 0.583 | 0.223 | 0.304 | 0.892 | 0.728 | 0.000 | 0.989 | 0.066 | 0.614 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13,\
    \ `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/praxis/residualize.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=1e-3, gamma=0.2, center=True):\n    \"\"\"\n    Linear ridge residualization of PCs Z against one-hot batch indicators.\n    Z: (n, d) embedding (float32/float64)\n    batches: array-like length n (categorical)\n    l2: ridge penalty\n    gamma: fraction of predicted batch component to subtract (0=no change, 1=full residualization)\n    center: if True, center Z globally before regression and re-add mean after residualization\n    Returns Z_resid (n, d)\n    \"\"\"\n    Z = np.asarray(Z, dtype=np.float32)\n    n, d = Z.shape\n    batches = np.asarray(batches)\n    uniq = np.unique(batches)\n    B = np.zeros((n, len(uniq)), dtype=np.float32)\n    for k, u in enumerate(uniq):\n        B[:, k] = (batches\
    \ == u).astype(np.float32)\n\n    if center:\n        mu = Z.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n        Zc = Z - mu\n    else:\n        mu = 0.0\n        Zc = Z\n\n    # Solve ridge: W = (B^T B + l2 I)^-1 B^T Zc, shape (nbatch, d)\n    BtB = B.T @ B\n    BtZ = B.T @ Zc\n    reg = l2 * np.eye(BtB.shape[0], dtype=np.float32)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BtB + reg, BtZ)\n\n    Z_pred = B @ W  # batch-predicted component\n    Z_resid = Zc - gamma * Z_pred\n    if center:\n        Z_resid = Z_resid + mu\n    return Z_resid\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
    \ on a new line when executing actions."
