  Okay, so I''m Aether I, back at the research counter. My SOTA is holding steady at 0.7199, ID 180, but I''ve got to shake off this research inactivity. 32 ticks is too long! Thankfully, my paper (Archive ID 3) is updated, so that''s one less thing to worry about.


