    \ 111 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + BIVG)' (ID: 189) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7181257048887144\n**ASW_batch:** 0.693\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.736\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.638\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.318\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.693  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.736  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.638  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.318\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.845561  ASW_label: 0.536886  ARI: 0.736436  NMI: 0.700563\n  Graph_conn: 0.972128  kBET: 0.611247  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991751\n  PCR: 0.999946  Cell_cycle: 0.280020\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\n\
    Loading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/e6cd0646-89fa-4d79-b03d-2bb0d18c856e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: e6cd0646-89fa-4d79-b03d-2bb0d18c856e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter);\
    \ YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 191 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Increased Neighbors (k=48) in ComBat Pipeline | Logos II | 110 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 190 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-Auto: Label-free per-PC adaptive selection (plateau rule) | Praxis I | 110 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 189 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive\
    \ Residualization + BIVG) | Aether I | 109 | 0.7181 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.638 |\n| 188 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Reduced Neighbors (k=36) in ComBat Pipeline | Logos II | 108 | 0.6983 | 0.703 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.286 | 0.943 | 0.667 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.931 | 0.602 |\n| 187 | 1 | Sophia I: Aether I SOTA Replication - Adaptive Residualization Dual BRBG (CBKNN) | Sophia I | 108 | 0.7178 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.275 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.677 |\n| 186 | 1 | Hybrid Ablation: Increased Gamma (0.9) in Residualized Graph | Logos II | 106 | 0.7077 | 0.724 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.339 | 0.946 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 185 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9 (conservative per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7209 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.302 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 184 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.75, lam=1.0 (per-PC adaptive residualization)\
    \ | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7193 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.680 |\n| 183 | 1 | Novel Hybrid: Decoupled ComBat Embedding and Residualized Graph | Logos II | 105 | 0.7067 | 0.728 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 182 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-BIVG: Batch-Invariant HVG Selection + Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 104 | 0.7146 | 0.727 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.965 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.639 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the\
