    \ / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.745, Lam 0.95)' (ID: 219) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7196000600469812\n**ASW_batch:** 0.703\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.732\n**NMI:** 0.694\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.681\n**iLISI:** 0.938\n**cLISI:** 0.970\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.289\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.703  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.732  NMI: 0.694\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.681  iLISI: 0.938  cLISI: 0.970\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.289\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850049  ASW_label: 0.536976  ARI: 0.731637  NMI: 0.694059\n  Graph_conn: 0.972813  kBET: 0.651023  iLISI: 0.938209  cLISI: 0.991267\n  PCR: 0.999957  Cell_cycle: 0.255736\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\n\
    Loading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/59527625-8eee-4d04-a259-1682b56997f0/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 59527625-8eee-4d04-a259-1682b56997f0\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter);\
    \ YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 221 | 1 | Graph Tuning: Proportional Neighbor Allocation | Daedalus II | 129 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 220 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 129 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 219 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive\
    \ Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.745, Lam 0.95) | Aether I | 128 | 0.7196 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 218 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Exact Balanced Quotas (k=45) with Adaptive Residualization | Praxis I | 127 | 0.7181 | 0.737 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.933 | 0.639 |\n| 217 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Increased PCA Components (n=70) | Logos II | 126 | 0.7010 | 0.690 | 0.703 | 0.215 | 0.287 | 0.957 | 0.658 | 1.000 | 0.961 | 0.933 | 0.607 |\n| 216 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph (Exact k=48) with Adaptive Residualization | Praxis I | 126 | 0.7179 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.317 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 215 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned - Gamma 0.76) | Aether I | 126 | 0.7194 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 214 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Reduced PCA Components (n=30) | Logos II | 125 | 0.7047\
    \ | 0.696 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.359 | 0.936 | 0.669 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.929 | 0.661 |\n| 213 | 1 | Distilled VAE (weight=0.5) + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 124 | 0.7180 | 0.747 | 0.605 | 0.234 | 0.355 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.693 |\n| 212 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Equal-Quota Graph k=42 (adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 124 | 0.7176 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.929 | 0.639 |\n\nPage 1 of 23 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-23, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
    \ is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
